{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:7df0fc29e1440de4","name":"Blazing Chain Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-7df0fc29e1440de4","title":"Blazing Chain Talent Tree","revision":16283,"timestamp":"2024-08-18T00:56:35Z","sha256":"eec58a0f341aa11ef5835cec2944f5ec1f6d04bf7fbb79ceede7f4205eb4f289","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=16283","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Blazing%20Chain%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-7df0fc29e1440de4","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unknown Regions Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unknown_Regions_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Blazing Chain members develop abilities that aid them in raids and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship"}," combat. They do not rely on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsabers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsabers","referenceId":"reference:420c60d0a682943a"},", so they apply ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"}," to blasters and other weapons in ways that other ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Traditions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Traditions","referenceId":"reference:da4e2621bc8ff060"}," have not attempted. Only Force-users that are part of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Blazing Chain"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Blazing_Chain","referenceId":"reference:8f9d636c89fcc833"}," may select ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talents"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talents","referenceId":"reference:e8871b70ebfa07d9"}," from this tree.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Force Directed Shot"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisites:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You use ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"}," to alter the flight of your blaster bolt, projectile, or similar missile from a thrown or ranged weapon. As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},", select one square within 12 squares of you and within your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"},". You treat that square as the origin square for your next ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ranged Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranged_Attack"}," with an Energy weapon made before the end of your next turn, and determine ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cover"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cover"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Concealment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Concealment"}," as though you were firing from that square. You must have ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"}," to the target of the attack from the square you occupy.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Negate and Redirect"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisites:"]}," ",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Negate Energy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Negate_Energy","referenceId":"reference:038d9df24b6fe0a9"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When you successfully use the ",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Negate Energy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Negate_Energy","referenceId":"reference:038d9df24b6fe0a9"}]}," Force Power against a ranged Energy weapon (such as a blaster), you can redirect some of the shot's energy at an enemy target, in addition to the Force Power's usual benefit. As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Free Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Free_Action"}," immediately following your successful use of the ",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Negate Energy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Negate_Energy","referenceId":"reference:038d9df24b6fe0a9"}]}," Force Power, choose one enemy within your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"},", and within 6 squares of you, and make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check against the target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["If your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check equals or exceeds the target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"},", the target takes Energy damage equal to one-half of the damage you negated.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Rising Anger"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisites:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Side Score"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Side_Score"}," of 1+, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Sensitivity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Sensitivity","referenceId":"reference:5202cab02f367bcf"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You tap directly into your anger to increase the effectiveness of your attacks. Once per round as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reaction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reaction"}," to an ally taking damage or being moved down the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"}," by an enemy, you gain a +1 morale bonus to your next attack roll. If you use this Talent again before you make an attack, the bonus increases by 1, up to a maximum of +5.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Rising Panic"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisites:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Side Score"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Side_Score"}," of 1+, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Sensitivity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Sensitivity","referenceId":"reference:5202cab02f367bcf"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You start a ",{"tag":"b","children":["Rising Panic"]}," in an enemy who observes your attacks and actions, inhibiting the enemy's ability to respond. Once per round as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reaction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reaction"}," to an enemy damaging one of your allies or moving one of your allies down the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"},", you can make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check against the target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["If the check equals or exceeds the target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"},", you move the target -1 step on the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"},". An enemy moved to the bottom of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"}," by this Talent does not fall unconscious, but instead must spend its actions fleeing combat for one minute or until it moves up the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"},". This is a Mind-Affecting Fear effect.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
